Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Navigation|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: Automatic Changes To Display Style
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|display.style.options=from-level-1-to-all-sublevels${line.separator}navigation.display.style[from-level-1-with-title]=root-layout,absolute,1,auto,true${line.separator}display.style.default=|
	When these properties
		|testray.component.names|Navigation|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Navigation Display Test Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Navigation Menu|
	And these variables
		|key_pageName|Navigation Display Test Page|
	Then AssertTextEquals the value 'Navigation Display Test Page' at locator 'Navigation#BREADCRUMB_ENTRY'

Scenario: User Personal Site User Group Private Page
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|layout.user.private.layouts.enabled=false${line.separator}layout.user.private.layouts.auto.create=false|
	When these properties
		|testray.component.names|Navigation|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	And Role assign Reg Role CP
		|roleTitle|Power User|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	And UserGroup add CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	And UserGroup add Page CP
		|pageName|Test User Group Private Page|
		|sitePagePrivacy|Private|
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|User Groups|
	And UserGroup assign Member CP
		|userGroupName|UG UserGroup Name|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And User logout PG
	And User login User PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
	And UserBar goto Dashboard
	And SitePageNavigator goto Pages
	And these variables
		|key_pageName|Test User Group Private Page|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Test User Group Private Page' at locator 'ProductMenu#PRIVATE_PAGE_LINK'
	And User logout User PG
	Then User login PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|

Scenario: Validate Return To Default Style
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|display.style.default=from-level-1-with-title${line.separator}navigation.display.style[from-level-1-with-title]=root-layout,absolute,1,auto,true|
	When these properties
		|testray.component.names|Navigation|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Navigation Display Test Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Navigation Menu|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Navigation Display Test Page|
	And these variables
		|key_pageName|Navigation Display Test Page|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Navigation Display Test Page' at locator 'Navigation#BREADCRUMB_ENTRY'
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|Navigation Menu|
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And SelectFrame at locator 'IFrame#CONFIGURATION'
	And Select the value 'Bar minimally styled' at locator 'Select#DISPLAY_TEMPLATE'
	And Button click Save
	And Alert view Success Message
	And SelectFrame the value 'relative=top'
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Navigation Display Test Page|
	Then AssertTextEquals the value 'Navigation Display Test Page' at locator 'Navigation#BREADCRUMB_ENTRY'

Scenario: View No Add Page Permissions PG
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|testray.component.names|Navigation,Permissions|
	When Page add
		|pageName|Navigation Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Navigation Page|
	And PermissionsInline goto Page PG
		|pageName|Navigation Page|
	And Role define Permission PG
		|permissionsList|CONTENT_PERMISSIONS_ADD_DISCUSSION_CHECKBOX,CONTENT_PERMISSIONS_CONFIGURE_APPLICATIONS_CHECKBOX,CONTENT_PERMISSIONS_CUSTOMIZE_CHECKBOX,CONTENT_PERMISSIONS_DELETE_CHECKBOX,CONTENT_PERMISSIONS_DELETE_DISCUSSION_CHECKBOX,CONTENT_PERMISSIONS_PERMISSIONS_CHECKBOX,CONTENT_PERMISSIONS_UPDATE_CHECKBOX,CONTENT_PERMISSIONS_UPDATE_DISCUSSION_CHECKBOX,CONTENT_PERMISSIONS_VIEW_CHECKBOX|
		|roleTitle|Power User|
	And IFrame select Top Frame
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Navigation Page|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	And Role assign Reg Role CP
		|roleTitle|Power User|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And User logout PG
	And User login User PG
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Navigation Page|
	And Dockbar view Add Tabs With No Add Page Permission
	And User logout PG
	Then User login User PG